'''Cavern of Comets''' (レンガと宇宙石の洞窟, ''Renga to Uchūseki no Dōkutsu'', '''Cave of Bricks and Space Stones''') is the [[Builder's Blitz Stages|Builder's Blitz]] stage that features [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies. These stages have a chance to drop Bricks or Meteorites when cleared. This event was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

